<p class="p0 ft0"><NOBR>PU/UPS/1-V.1/10(BI)</NOBR></p>
<p class="p1 ft1">DECLARATION FORM FOR REGISTRATION OF COMPANY/CONSULTING FIRM WITH</p>
<p class="p2 ft1">THE MINISTRY OF FINANCE MALAYSIA</p>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="t0">
